U0 StonecutterScreen_Init(StonecutterScreen *s,MCScreenHost012 *h){s->host=h;s->base=h->createCraftingBase(h->host,1);h->setSingleCategory(h->host,s->base,1,5);}U0 StonecutterScreen_Destroy(StonecutterScreen *s){s->host->destroyCraftingBase(s->host->host,s->base);}Bool StonecutterScreen_filterRecipe(StonecutterScreen *s,MCFilterItem009 *result,MCFilterTiles009 *tiles){return CraftingFilters_isStonecutterItem(result,tiles);}
